        {
          "review_id": "06d4c78d-73b4-4b54-9ef3-3d5a0d18cb96",
          "excerpt": "It was working fine and all and would've gotten a 5 star if it hadn't been for this glitch I've started to experience just this December. when I want to play my playlist, it does NOT play?! I have to delete the app and reinstall again and again for it to work but it just happens again! Please do fix this.",
